# Enemy NPC unit: upright capsule carrying a small team-1 field bubble - friendly emitter fields
# physically push it back (applied-force readback), and its bubble presses on the player's shield.
# Spawned from the objective by NpcSystem; steers toward the nearest structure and gnaws it in
# attack range. ContactEvents feed projectile hit damage.
Prefab gameEnemyUnit
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cube
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.25 0.2
		Scale 0.5 0.8 0.5
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Capsule
		Radius 0.5
		HalfHeight 0.3
		Density 100
		Friction 0.3
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 0.8
		Reach 3
		Centered true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
